# eval venv + build artifacts + regenerable outputs.
# predictions/ and out/ are derived; reference/ is the frozen CodeBLEU baseline; aimock/ is recorded
# LLM traffic (re-recordable). traces/ (downloaded LangSmith data, re-fetchable via
# fetch_experiments.py) is left committable so the canonical traces/final-experiments/ set can be
# checked in if desired; the big daily dumps stay untracked by choice.
.venv/
.venv-eval/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
out/
predictions/
aimock/
manual-eval/wwi/**/*
